{"title":"Mathtime Version 1 Edition 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Mathtime Magazine Volume 1 Edition 1 is <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathtimemag.co.cc/1_2_MathTime-Magazine.html\">here</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Number_Theory\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Number Theory</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Problem_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Problem_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Problem_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Problem_8\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 8</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Problem_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 9</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Problem_10\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 10</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Problem_11\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 11</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Number_Theory\">Number Theory</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Number Theory\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?f=768&amp;t=447930\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/3547351abf03ab0b6cbda7b0b905b2e4f6220e1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /></a>\n</p><p>What is the last digit of the product of all odd integers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/845c669ea507209c92cdce04e32b7f50e587ac03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,000?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?f=768&amp;t=447931\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/e/b5e8656291085c388b48a0fa8da85aed21c483bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /></a>\n</p><p>What is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efe8f67ac18da14c8aa767b8131b0650ac9b9720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2011$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />th letter in the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/8/1b8133c2f3a7ded2bdb147ad0c0e86f1d2fb1f18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{MATHLETEMATHLETEMATHLETE}\\ldots?$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"319\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>(Inspiration of Problem: Alcumus/AMC 8)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?f=768&amp;t=447932\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/433d742232f7bf3512c11eb996630ff5ead3641f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /></a>\n</p><p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/a/d4a3d3250cd9522faff508f4720c6a1f2e4b4c78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{4042110}{4038090}?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?f=768&amp;t=447935\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/4/6c4c6c07150a0f6e56b0a6e198d1d19155dfe96c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" /></a>\n</p><p>What is the sum of the digits of the square root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/6/fb6e668846ac0bf877222bf38edc91ca5b0e78dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9801?$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?f=768&amp;t=447936\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897a203bdf45af36f2b9edc59c3bc0beeb898be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /></a>\n</p><p>Find the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/3/1f37aac6a4466be7c77640d481171ef1ec54bc0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35435_{7}+13362_{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" /> in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?f=768&amp;t=447937\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adb760a2c7143780db481b394ada34e0bb23b3bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" /></a>\n</p><p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/c/afc4abf5e734f2ec922fbfe6e7b574eeb95f0587.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$111_{2}+222_{4}+444_{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"17\" /> in binary form.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\">Problem 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?f=768&amp;t=447938\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/1/94152541528ed008abea53ff30e18a07a3c37f51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /></a>\n</p><p>Find the difference between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/005850986ccc7e8c16c6c3920a383279d3d76e89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$444_{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/2/b32905404713f3ea7fb070e40170589a2e434f63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222_{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> in base 8.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_8\">Problem 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?f=768&amp;t=447939\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e81ca9c5c8715be868438500743202d6773d05bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /></a>\n</p><p>In what base is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/567b5068ae2290fdc5af1207dc7f580ee48dc396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$66+87+85+48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"138\" height=\"14\" /> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/e/3be765e106c30b7aefb104ac1e53454972cdcba6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$132?$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\">Problem 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?f=768&amp;t=447940\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/4/374ad4e9adc96666cde62dd31911b54d38e83c56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /></a>\n</p><p>Find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/2/5b22439738476a637db923393f6addf6d2edd0c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$324_{5}+18_{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"15\" /> in base ten.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_10\">Problem 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?f=768&amp;t=447941\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/7/cd7ae6c302dec5c5be789f3d4d9be37d000d0772.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" /></a>\n</p><p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/6/756c96e0399e7933ff4cc8ce08eb1e9f4d0f12a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0_{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/c/68cefe2535319d82409234305953f48fcfb27089.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1_{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9b2c5f65680683b75bc07f7ce97a689e499e5cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2_{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/b/aeb8c8e4ae5d21aa239a4facc85bc70c2f79202f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3_{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/7/597c31ef6588c446737a18db48901cd14d6b402d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1230_{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> in binary form?\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_11\">Problem 11</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 11\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?f=768&amp;t=447942\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/3/dd34aa5e4f49c065b66db919bf81d6d611bc2bd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" /></a>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/6/3a6b642bf379e2054b95628396d0a521c68e5aaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv0\\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/8/a3818f406a7fdfd9a5c50a8377113adf3cbc29ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv0\\pmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/8/f48391edd8726ee02110d595870229b8a680f255.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv1\\pmod{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />. What is the smallest positive integer that satisfies the above?\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018095131\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 193/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5957/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:10497:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018095131 and revision id 43571. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}